+function [x_set y_set z_set numSamples] = ReadFiles(folder,debugMode)
+% function [x_set y_set z_set numSamples] = ReadFiles(folder,debugMode)
+%
+% -------------------------------------------------------------------------
+% Author: Barbara Bruno (dept. DIBRIS, University of Genova, ITALY)
+%
+% This code is the implementation of the algorithms described in the
